Sorry for the delay.  I'm not at work every day and I had to be at the
server to try it out in those systems.  Anyway, I do not have any
issue with R 2.15.0, so I am guessing it is some change in R devel.
Next week I will update to the most recent version and see if that
makes any difference.  I am not sure what has changed though.  The
only thing I see is that some C code has been moved to the graphics
package and there have been some updates to tiff()/X11().  I am using
the png device, so I'm not sure how those are relevant.

Anyway, thanks for looking into it.  I know I can use 2.15 for now.

Cheers,

Josh

