knitr-manual.Rnw is too big to diagnose the problem; you can cook up a
smaller Rnw document, e.g.

\documentclass{article}
\begin{document}
<<dev='tikz'>>=
plot(1)
@
\end{document}

If this does not work on your local or network drive but pdflatex
works separately, you probably need to report to RStudio developers.

